        "created_at": "2015-05-21T11:37:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.vg247.com/2013/02/11/releasing-a-game-demo-can-cut-your-sales-in-half-warns-schell/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"01:42PM - 11 February 2013\">VG247 – 11 Feb 13</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:668/190;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b6d4e4ab9abf9c814a4a3a6a5c0e42e1716edd73.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"668\" height=\"190\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.vg247.com/2013/02/11/releasing-a-game-demo-can-cut-your-sales-in-half-warns-schell/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Releasing a game demo can cut your sales in half, warns Schell - VG247</a></h3>\n\n<p>Schell games CEO and industry analyst Jesse Schell has warned that releasing a demo of your game before launch can kill your sales. Schell argues his case against releasing a demo at DICE Summit 2013 last week, and he had the stats to back up his...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
