        "id": 141826,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-21T13:18:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd recommend stop playing MMO's and stop giving them your money.</p><p>Sometimes for something to change, it has to die first. Think the ending of <em>\"Cabin in the Woods\"&nbsp;</em></p><p><span>&nbsp;And since your posting in a tabletop biased forum, I'd highly recommend getting into tabletop. Take it from someone who used to run a top US raiding guild back in the day. The social aspect is much healthier.&nbsp;</span></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:18:59.812Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
