        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;d recommend stop playing MMO&#39;s and stop giving them your money.</p><p>Sometimes for something to change, it has to die first. Think the ending of <em>&quot;Cabin in the Woods&quot;&nbsp;</em></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;And since your posting in a tabletop biased forum, I&#39;d highly recommend getting into tabletop. Take it from someone who used to run a top US raiding guild back in the day. The social aspect is much healthier.&nbsp;</span></p>",
